BenchmarkCommitmentPublicResponse.description:
GET /{slug}/commitment — guest-safe verification surface (SPEC D10).

Root, anchor evidence, and timing only. Salts and gold never appear (D3);
the root covers them only as salted keccak leaves.

OwnerReputationRead.description:
Owner-scoped reputation (Path C). OWNER-AUTH ONLY — doxxing surface.

``wallet_addresses`` + ``completed_volume`` together identify payout history;
never expose this on a public route.
